  "post_content": "<p>Este s&aacute;bado, 24 de enero,&nbsp;se ha celebrado en Fanzara la segunda conferencia del ciclo <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=urqO7z7e5KU&amp;feature=share\" target=\"_blank\">&#39;Yo soy marciano en Fanzara&#39;, a cargo de Bel&eacute;n Garc&iacute;a Pardo con el t&iacute;tulo MIAU: Vinculaciones entre grafiti y postgrafiti. Deih o Insider</a>.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/01/IMG_0241.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>Ha presentado a la conferenciante el ondense <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=djcx49mLyOE&amp;feature=share\" target=\"_blank\">Joan Feliu Franch, uno de los codirectores de MARTE, organizadora del ciclo junto&nbsp;al Museo Inacabado de Arte Urbano (MIAU), y encargado&nbsp;de realizar la conferencia inaugural, &iquest;En serio esto es arte?, el 10 de enero</a>.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/01/CharlasMARTEfanzara.png\" style=\"height: 528px; width: 374px\" /></p>\n<p>Las conferencias se desarrollan en el sal&oacute;n de actos del Centro Cultural cada quince d&iacute;as, en s&aacute;bado por la tarde, y quedan dos.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciabelengarciapardomiau240115/img_0242.jpg\" alt=\"img_0242\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciabelengarciapardomiau240115/img_0245.jpg\" alt=\"img_0245\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciabelengarciapardomiau240115/img_0248.jpg\" alt=\"img_0248\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciabelengarciapardomiau240115/img_0249.jpg\" alt=\"img_0249\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciabelengarciapardomiau240115/img_0252.jpg\" alt=\"img_0252\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciabelengarciapardomiau240115/img_0254.jpg\" alt=\"img_0254\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciabelengarciapardomiau240115/img_0255.jpg\" alt=\"img_0255\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciabelengarciapardomiau240115/img_0257.jpg\" alt=\"img_0257\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciabelengarciapardomiau240115/img_0260.jpg\" alt=\"img_0260\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciabelengarciapardomiau240115/img_0261.jpg\" alt=\"img_0261\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciabelengarciapardomiau240115/img_0264.jpg\" alt=\"img_0264\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciabelengarciapardomiau240115/img_0265.jpg\" alt=\"img_0265\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
